OL,3,AFamily row over George Michael items up
OL,4,Afor auction - including Faith guitar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family row has broken out over an
OL,7,Fauction of George Michael memorabilia
OL,8,Ftaking place on Thursday.
OL,10,FThe guitar played by the
OL,11,Fsinger-songwriter in the Faith music
OL,12,Fvideo is one of several items being
OL,13,Fauctioned by Sworders from the
OL,14,Fcollection of Siobhan Bailey, Michael's
OL,15,Flong-time personal assistant.
OL,17,FSiobhan died in 2014 and the items are
OL,18,Fbeing sold by her estranged husband Ian
OL,19,FBelcher, who inherited them after her
OL,20,Fdeath.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
